sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Odoo payload
    participant P as Paraguay services
    participant T as mTLS transport
    participant S as SIFEN
    O->>P: Normalized payload
    P->>P: UTC instant to America/Asuncion
    P->>P: Unsigned DE
    P->>P: CDC and DE@Id
    P->>P: XMLDSig
    P->>P: Persist current signed artifact; preserve superseded versions
    P->>P: QR and gCamFuFD
    P->>P: Persist exact current QR payload
    P->>P: Final rDE
    P->>P: Official XSD validation
    P->>P: SOAP 1.2 rEnviDe
    P->>T: Original SOAP bytes
    T->>S: HTTPS POST with client certificate
    S-->>T: HTTP / SOAP response
    T-->>P: Immutable transport result
    P-->>O: Structured parsed result
    O->>P: Persisted payload plus exact QR artifact
    P->>P: Deterministic KuDE rendering
    P-->>O: Versioned KuDE PDF artifact
